:: work
<img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="centerHouse" />

<hr>

<<addHours 8>>\
<<set $player.workedToday = true>>\
You spend 8 hours working on your job as $player.job.name
<<cash $player.job.pay>>
You currently own $$$player.cash

<<keyOption "Return home" home 🏠>>
:: homeImage
<img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="centerHouse" />

<hr>

:: home
<<include homeImage>>
You are currently in front of your home.
<<unlessLateToJob>>
    <<keyOption "Go inside" main 🚪>>
    <<include workOption>>\
    <<keyOption "Look for kids in the playground" playground ⚽>>
<</unlessLateToJob>>
:: playground
<img class="centerHouse" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"/>

<hr>

<<set $found_kid = Person.generate()>>
You found a $found_kid.age year old $found_kid.skin $found_kid.title with $found_kid.hairLength $found_kid.hairStyle $found_kid.hairColor hair \
and $found_kid.eyeColor eyes named $found_kid.name

<<keyOption "Kidnap $found_kid.addressing" kidnap 🖐>>: 30min
<<keyOption "Keep searching" playground 🔍>>
<<keyOption "Return home" home 🏠>>
:: kidnap
<<include homeImage>>
<<set $slaves.push($found_kid)>>\
<<addMinutes 30>>\
You start stalking the $found_kid.age year old kid waiting for the right moment.

A while later you see the kid standing all alone in a corner. You look around making sure no one sees you and quickly use the chloroform \
on $found_kid.addressing mouth.

Surprised, the kid takes a deep breath on the chloroform soaked handerkief. You feel his strength quickly running out and \
$found_kid.addressing cute limbs falling right in your arms.

You cover $found_kid.addressing body in a blanket and sneak up back to your home with your new toy.

<<keyOption "Enter the basement" basement 🚪>>